      "threshold": 35,
      "scope": "CORRECTED 2026-09-07 — NOT whole-cart total, NOT contact-lens subtotal. It is the EYEGLASSES / SPECTACLE-FRAME category subtotal in the cart.",
      "rule": "if the eyeglasses-category subtotal in the cart is >= EUR 35, none of the per-product minimums above apply to contact lens line items in that same cart — customer may add e.g. a single box.",
      "removal_flow": "if the customer then removes/edits an eyeglasses item at checkout such that the eyeglasses-category subtotal would drop below EUR 35 while contact lenses are present below their per-SKU minimum, the customer must be prompted first: removing this eyewear item will also remove the paired contact lenses. If the customer confirms and proceeds with the removal, the per-product contact-lens minimums re-activate and are enforced on the cart page, evaluated product-by-product (not a single aggregate check).",
      "storefront_scope": "RESOLVED (owner, 2026-09-07): contact lenses are sold on optiwar.com only, never on optiwar.in — same app/codebase, different pricing mechanisms per site. optiwar.com therefore carries both eyeglasses and contact lenses in the same catalog/cart, which is what makes this eyeglasses-subtotal-gates-lens-minimums rule possible. This entire cart_value_override block applies to optiwar.com only; optiwar.in has no contact-lens minimums to gate in the first place.",
